abstract: "Reproducible scholarly history of Crescent City, California — from Tolowa Dee-ni' settlement through the 1964 tsunami to today, with deterministically generated matplotlib figures, BibTeX validation, and PDF build via Pandoc + XeLaTeX + pandoc-crossref (Python, uv, pytest)."
